# CLAUDE.local.md (example)

Copy this file to `CLAUDE.local.md` for personal, machine-specific preferences.
The real `CLAUDE.local.md` is gitignored and never committed.

Use it for:
- personal workflow preferences (e.g., preferred verbosity, language)
- local environment notes (paths, local server quirks)
- temporary personal reminders

NEVER put real secrets, API keys, or tokens in this file. Secrets belong in `.env` (gitignored).
